<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="S3.F2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of Performance in Resource-Constrained Computing Environments.<span id="S3.F2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Comparison of three models on the quantization and fine-tuning task. All models were trained on the same computing infrastructure (Nvidia GeForce RTX 2080 TI 11GB) for fair comparison. The training time represents the average time per epoch, with OmniQuant used as quantization example in this figure. </span></span></figcaption>
