<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T15.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 15</span>: </span><span id="A4.T15.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Performance Comparison of Traditional W8A8 PTQ with DNABERT-2.<span id="A4.T15.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> This table shows the performance of all models on the Traditional W8A8 post-training quantization (PTQ).</span></span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<div id="A4.T15.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:38.3pt;vertical-align:-17.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-73.8pt,11.7pt) scale(0.62068615402064,0.62068615402064) ;">
