<figure id="A4.T22" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T22.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 22</span>: </span><span id="A4.T22.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of Quantization Methods in Large-Scale Models.<span id="A4.T22.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> This comparison analyzes the performance of various quantization methods, including FP16, W6A6, W4A4, Outlier, SmoothQuant, and OmniQuant, on Nucleotide Transformer 2.5B models. The best results are highlighted in bold, while the second-best results are underlined.</span></span></figcaption>
